              "text": " gelten.   * Die Zerlegung lautet also: "
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "tex": "x = a^{p-k-m}, \\; y = a^k, \\; z = a^m b^p"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " (wobei "
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "tex": "p-k-m + k + m = p"
